      "medium": "Page",
      "excerpt": "Protect EBITDA yields, calibrate welcome promo richness, and defend player lifetime value (LTV) against competitive promo pressure.",
      "description": "Protect EBITDA yields, calibrate welcome promo richness, and defend player lifetime value (LTV) against competitive promo pressure.",
      "author": "Jurnii Research",
      "tags": [],
      "order": 99,
      "productRefs": [],
