    "rawContent": "\n[Powered by Cortex](../../products/cortex.html)\n\nUse Case — Financial Confidence\n\n# For Chief Financial Officer\n\nReconcile promotional campaign spend with causal attribution models, evaluate welcome offer incrementality, and align commercial marketing budgets with strict EBITDA margin protections.\n\n[Model Your Corporate Marketing ROI](mailto:demo@jurnii.io?subject=Request%20Demo%20-%20Chief%20Financial%20Officer) [Explore Product Stack](../../products/cortex.html)\n\nCortex Finance Reconciliation Audited\n\nTotal program spend: $17.1M\n\nIncremental CAC lift: +46% ROI\n\nRedundant spend recovered: $4.85M\n\n*   **+46%** — True Marketing ROI Lift\n*   **$4.85M** — Inefficient Spend Reallocated\n*   **3x** — Attribution Analysis Speed\n*   **40x** — ROI on Platform Investment\n\nAudience Operating Context\n\nFinancial leaders deploy Jurnii Cortex to establish single-source-of-truth marketing attribution, validating programmatic search displays and media mix efficiency through causal incrementality forecasts.\n\nAudience Pressure Vectors\n\n## The Pressure Under Audit\n\nCFOs are presented with vague last-click attribution sheets from marketing teams that obscure real competitor promotions surges, causing high acquisition spend leakage and massive margin hold dilution.\n\n#### Direct Operational Pressures\n\nVerify marketing budget effectiveness, defend spend against flat ROAS assumptions, and prevent competitor welcome bonuses from eroding margins.\n\n#### Information Barrier\n\n**Currently delayed or missing data:** Audited causal campaign lift metrics that separate organic players baseline from competitor offer sweeps.\n\n### How Jurnii Restores Alignment\n\nCortex processes marketing data warehouses side-by-side with competitor promotional timelines to isolate true incremental spend yields and reallocate underperforming programmatic display budgets.\n\nEBITDA Yield Implication\n\nOpinion-driven roadmaps and copycat promotions pricing dilutes Net Gaming wagers hold rates by up to **35%** globally.\n\nOperational Rhythm Comparison\n\n## Restructuring Broken Team Workflows\n\n### Before Jurnii Usability & Radar\n\n*   ❌ Marketing requests budget extensions based on flawed last-click charts.\n*   ❌ Operators bleed acquisition cash bidding blindly against competitor surges.\n*   ❌ Finance and marketing clash over untrackable promotion conversions.\n\n### After Jurnii automated surveillance\n\n*   ✅ Cortex causal models isolate true organic campaign yield contribution.\n*   ✅ programmatic display bids are shifted away from un-incremental segments.\n*   ✅ Finance and marketing align around a unified, board-ready spend model.\n\nDecision Grid\n\n## Strategic Decision Map\n\nCritical Decision\n\nInformation Signal Needed\n\nJurnii Operational Yield Output\n\n**Are media spends driving incrementality?**\n\nCortex causal lift scores vs competitor promo actions\n\nAudited spend performance report\n\n**What is our real CRM margin leakage?**\n\nPlayer bonuses distributions vs wagers rollovers\n\nCalibrated CRM bonus distribution limit rules\n\nWeekly Timelines\n\n## Weekly Commercial Rhythm\n\nMon\n\n### Spend Sync\n\nReconcile programmatic displays spend vs rival welcome events.\n\nTue\n\n### Attribution\n\nIsolate incremental organic campaign yields in Cortex.\n\nThu\n\n### Margin Audit\n\nVerify player loyalty matches against target margin holds.\n\nFri\n\n### Board Review\n\nDeliver audited EBITDA contribution reports to directors.\n\nProduct Integrations\n\n## Relevant Jurnii Stack\n\nAttribution Stack\n\n### Cortex\n\nCausal Media Mix Modeling (MMM) attribution and scenario planning simulation dashboards to reallocate spent with evidence.\n\n[Explore Cortex →](../../products/cortex.html)\n\nSurveillance Stack\n\n### Jurnii 360\n\nContinuous real-time competitive intelligence scraping welcome offers and wagers matches to protect wagers margins.\n\n[Explore Jurnii 360 →](../../products/jurnii-360.html)\n\nTarget Outcomes\n\n## Commercial Outcomes That Matter\n\n### Audited ROI Confidence\n\nReplace subjective marketing spreadsheets with audited, scientifically accurate causal spent proof.\n\n### protected Margins\n\nCalibrate promotions and CRM bonuses directly against strict corporate EBITDA thresholds."
