    "bodyHtml": "<p>Executive Personas</p>\n<h1>Use Cases &amp; Segment: Roles</h1>\n<p>Align critical commercial, operational, and marketing leaders around single-source market facts.</p>\n<p>Choose your operating context below to explore tailored parities.</p>\n<p>[</p>\n<h3>For CMO</h3>\n<p>Eliminate last-click attribution leaks, isolate campaign incrementality, and align media mix budgets with Jurnii 360 competitive intelligence and Cortex causal modeling.</p>\n<p>Explore Operating View</p>\n<p>](roles/cmo.html)[</p>\n<h3>For CCO</h3>\n<p>Protect EBITDA yields, calibrate welcome promo richness, and defend player lifetime value (LTV) against competitive promo pressure.</p>\n<p>Explore Operating View</p>\n<p>](roles/cco.html)[</p>\n<h3>For COO</h3>\n<p>Accelerate product development cycles, eliminate player onboarding friction, and align cross-functional engineering and product pipelines with Jurnii UX automated scoring.</p>\n<p>Explore Operating View</p>\n<p>](roles/coo.html)[</p>\n<h3>For CPO</h3>\n<p>Benchmark product UX layouts against competitor portals, rank customer registration issues by GGR impact, and align technical pipelines around objective usability scoring.</p>\n<p>Explore Operating View</p>\n<p>](roles/cpo.html)[</p>\n<h3>For CFO</h3>\n<p>Reconcile promotional campaign spend with causal attribution models, evaluate welcome offer incrementality, and align commercial marketing budgets with strict EBITDA margin protections.</p>\n<p>Explore Operating View</p>\n<p>](roles/cfo.html)[</p>\n<h3>For CEO</h3>\n<p>Establish complete regional market visibility, standardize portfolio experience scoring, and align scaling departments around verified commercial and product truths.</p>\n<p>Explore Operating View</p>\n<p>](roles/ceo.html)[</p>\n<h3>For Head of Product</h3>\n<p>Diagnose registration form friction, accelerate document upload steps, and deliver flawless conversion loops across web and mobile portfolios.</p>\n<p>Explore Operating View</p>\n<p>](roles/head-of-product.html)[</p>\n<h3>For Head of Marketing</h3>\n<p>Calibrate paid search bids against live competitor welcome matches, optimize acquisition banner copy, and maximize paid media campaigns yield.</p>\n<p>Explore Operating View</p>\n<p>](roles/head-of-marketing.html)[</p>\n<h3>For Head of CRM</h3>\n<p>Combat player churn contextually by triggering defensive loyalty bonuses when competitor promotions pressure spikes, protecting player lifetime values.</p>\n<p>Explore Operating View</p>\n<p>](roles/head-of-crm.html)</p>\n",
    "rawContent": "\nExecutive Personas\n\n# Use Cases & Segment: Roles\n\nAlign critical commercial, operational, and marketing leaders around single-source market facts.\n\nChoose your operating context below to explore tailored parities.\n\n[\n\n### For CMO\n\nEliminate last-click attribution leaks, isolate campaign incrementality, and align media mix budgets with Jurnii 360 competitive intelligence and Cortex causal modeling.\n\nExplore Operating View\n\n](roles/cmo.html)[\n\n### For CCO\n\nProtect EBITDA yields, calibrate welcome promo richness, and defend player lifetime value (LTV) against competitive promo pressure.\n\nExplore Operating View\n\n](roles/cco.html)[\n\n### For COO\n\nAccelerate product development cycles, eliminate player onboarding friction, and align cross-functional engineering and product pipelines with Jurnii UX automated scoring.\n\nExplore Operating View\n\n](roles/coo.html)[\n\n### For CPO\n\nBenchmark product UX layouts against competitor portals, rank customer registration issues by GGR impact, and align technical pipelines around objective usability scoring.\n\nExplore Operating View\n\n](roles/cpo.html)[\n\n### For CFO\n\nReconcile promotional campaign spend with causal attribution models, evaluate welcome offer incrementality, and align commercial marketing budgets with strict EBITDA margin protections.\n\nExplore Operating View\n\n](roles/cfo.html)[\n\n### For CEO\n\nEstablish complete regional market visibility, standardize portfolio experience scoring, and align scaling departments around verified commercial and product truths.\n\nExplore Operating View\n\n](roles/ceo.html)[\n\n### For Head of Product\n\nDiagnose registration form friction, accelerate document upload steps, and deliver flawless conversion loops across web and mobile portfolios.\n\nExplore Operating View\n\n](roles/head-of-product.html)[\n\n### For Head of Marketing\n\nCalibrate paid search bids against live competitor welcome matches, optimize acquisition banner copy, and maximize paid media campaigns yield.\n\nExplore Operating View\n\n](roles/head-of-marketing.html)[\n\n### For Head of CRM\n\nCombat player churn contextually by triggering defensive loyalty bonuses when competitor promotions pressure spikes, protecting player lifetime values.\n\nExplore Operating View\n\n](roles/head-of-crm.html)\n"
