    "bodyHtml": "<h1>Contact Jurnii</h1>\n<p>Interested in seeing Jurnii in action or discussing an audit for your operator?</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Sales &amp; Demos</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:sales@jurnii.io\">sales@jurnii.io</a></li>\n<li><strong>General Inquiries</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:hello@jurnii.io\">hello@jurnii.io</a></li>\n<li><strong>Headquarters</strong>: London, United Kingdom</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Book a 45-minute demo to see live intelligence for your peer operator set.</p>\n",
