      "excerpt": "Ekimetrics is a serious MMM consultancy. Here's where the model fits — and where the iGaming gap opens.",
      "description": "Ekimetrics is a serious MMM consultancy. Here's where the model fits — and where the iGaming gap opens.",
      "author": "Timothy Solomon",
